# Quantumult X remote filter - ChatGPT / OpenAI
# Updated: 2026-11-06
# Source: OpenAI Help Center network recommendations (2026-10)
# Policy: GPT (choose a stable proxy node for this policy in QX)
# Covers ChatGPT iOS/web, authentication, content, Codex WebSocket hosts.
# Exact shared third-party hosts limited to OpenAI-documented endpoints.
# This filter does not configure the proxy or guarantee long-lived WebSocket stability.
host-suffix, chatgpt.com, GPT
host-suffix, openai.com, GPT
host-suffix, oaistatic.com, GPT
host-suffix, oaiusercontent.com, GPT
host-suffix, oaistatsig.com, GPT
host, cdn.openaimerge.com, GPT
